<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Explore Courier Co services including same-day delivery, scheduled courier work, business transport, and collection support.">
    <title>Courier Co | Services</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/images/favicon-16x16.png">
</head>
<body>
    <header class="navbar">
        <div class="site-title">
            <a href="/">Courier Co</a>
        </div>

        <input type="checkbox" id="menu-checkbox" hidden>
        <label for="menu-checkbox" class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Open menu">☰</label>

        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="/about">About Us</a></li>
                <li><a href="/services">Services</a></li>
                <li><a href="/enquiries">Enquiries &amp; Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="services-page">
        <section class="services-intro">
            <p class="eyebrow">Delivery solutions for different needs</p>
            <h1>Our Courier Services</h1>
            <p>
                Courier Co provides dependable delivery solutions for individuals and businesses.
                Whether you need an urgent same-day drop, a scheduled collection, or regular business
                support, we offer services designed around speed, reliability, and flexibility.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="services-grid-section">
            <div class="services-grid">
                <article class="service-card">
                    <h2>Same-Day Delivery</h2>
                    <p>
                        Best for urgent local deliveries that need immediate collection and fast turnaround.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="service-features">
                        <li>Rapid response for urgent jobs</li>
                        <li>Suitable for documents and parcels</li>
                        <li>Direct transport with minimal delay</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="service-tag">Best for: urgent deliveries</p>
                </article>

                <article class="service-card">
                    <h2>Scheduled Delivery</h2>
                    <p>
                        Ideal for planned logistics where collections and drop-offs can be booked in advance.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="service-features">
                        <li>Flexible pre-booked transport</li>
                        <li>Useful for repeat or planned jobs</li>
                        <li>Works around customer timetables</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="service-tag">Best for: planned deliveries</p>
                </article>

                <article class="service-card">
                    <h2>Business Courier Services</h2>
                    <p>
                        Reliable courier support for businesses needing regular parcel, document, or contract delivery.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="service-features">
                        <li>Consistent support for repeat clients</li>
                        <li>Suitable for office and commercial deliveries</li>
                        <li>Built for dependable ongoing service</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="service-tag">Best for: business accounts</p>
                </article>

                <article class="service-card">
                    <h2>Collection &amp; Drop-Off</h2>
                    <p>
                        A practical option for customers who need parcels collected from one location and safely delivered to another.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="service-features">
                        <li>Door-to-door collection support</li>
                        <li>Simple and convenient process</li>
                        <li>Suitable for one-off bookings</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="service-tag">Best for: simple one-off jobs</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="service-comparison">
            <h2>Which service is right for you?</h2>
            <div class="comparison-table">
                <div class="comparison-row comparison-head">
                    <span>Service</span>
                    <span>Best for</span>
                    <span>Speed</span>
                </div>
                <div class="comparison-row">
                    <span>Same-Day Delivery</span>
                    <span>Urgent local jobs</span>
                    <span>Fastest</span>
                </div>
                <div class="comparison-row">
                    <span>Scheduled Delivery</span>
                    <span>Pre-booked transport</span>
                    <span>Flexible</span>
                </div>
                <div class="comparison-row">
                    <span>Business Courier</span>
                    <span>Regular company deliveries</span>
                    <span>Ongoing support</span>
                </div>
                <div class="comparison-row">
                    <span>Collection &amp; Drop-Off</span>
                    <span>Simple one-off delivery tasks</span>
                    <span>Standard</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="services-cta">
            <h2>Ready to request a quote?</h2>
            <p>
                Tell us what you need delivered and we will help match you with the most suitable courier service.
            </p>
            <a href="/enquiries" class="btn">Send an Enquiry</a>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
        <div class="footer-left">
            <a href="https://www.facebook.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Facebook</a>
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a>
            <a href="https://twitter.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">X</a>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-center">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Courier Co</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-right">
            <img src="/images/courier-co.jpg" alt="Courier Co logo" class="footer-logo">
        </div>

        <div class="footer-credits">
            <p>
                Images courtesy of
                <a href="https://unsplash.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Unsplash</a>
                and
                <a href="https://www.freepik.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Freepik</a>.
                Favicon from
                <a href="https://favicon.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">favicon.io</a>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>